====Evolution I====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Kill '''100''' enemies with the Innodem
*Reach '''5x''' Combo and then [[Melee#Heavy%20Attack|Heavy Attack]] to activate Incarnon Form.
**'''+3''' Range.
**'''+40%''' Attack Speed.
*Incarnon Form lasts for '''90''' seconds and persists until [[death]].

====Evolution II====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Activate Incarnon Form '''6''' times in a mission
**Refreshing the duration will '''not''' count toward the challenge.
*Perk 1: '''Orokin Reach''':
**'''+0.5''' Range
*Perk 2: '''Bladed Harmony''':
**'''+25%''' [[Attack Speed]]
*Perk 3: '''Striking Swiftness''':
**'''+30%''' [[Sprint Speed]]

====Evolution III====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Complete '''3''' Heavy Attacks on [[Thrax Centurion|Thrax Centurions]] or [[Thrax Legatus|Legates]]
*Perk 1: '''Hawk Momentum''':
**Gain '''5''' Combo for every 10m of continuous slide.
***Only counts slide distance while grounded.
***Weapon must be in hand for perk to apply.
*Perk 2: '''Skyborne Hunter''':
**Increase range of aerial melee attacks by '''+0.5m'''.
*Perk 3: '''Blade Twister''':
**'''+60%''' Finisher Damage

====Evolution IV====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Close '''12''' Ruptures in [[Void Flood]]
*Perk 1: '''Incarnon Imago''':
**Reach '''3x''' Combo and Heavy Attack to activate Incarnon Form
*Perk 2: '''Swooping Lunge''':
**On Airborne Melee Kill: '''+50%''' Melee Damage for '''10s'''. Stacks up to 3x.
***Incarnon Form projectile and {{D|Slash}}, {{D|Heat}}, and {{D|Toxin}} proc kills while airborne count towards generating stacks.
*Perk 3: '''Protracted Execution''':
**'''20''' Combo on Finisher

====Evolution V====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Complete a Solo mission with an Incarnon Weapon equipped in every slot
*Perk 1: '''Blood Anointed''':
**On Finisher: '''+40%''' Heavy Attack Efficiency for '''40s'''
*Perk 2: '''Stunning Brutality''':
**On Finisher: Stun aware enemies in a '''10m''' Radius
*Perk 3: '''Armed Inspiration''':
**Collecting ammo grants '''5''' Melee Combo counter

==Tips==
*Using an [[Exalted Weapon]] will negate Evolution V challenge.
*Incarnon Genesis weapons are counted for Evolution V challenge.
*The Innodem synergizes particularly well with {{Focus|Naramon}} Focus, due to {{Focus|Sling Stun}} granting an easy way to open enemies up to finishers.
**In addition, {{Focus|Killer's Rush}} causes a finisher from Operator form to increase critical chance. Performing a finisher in this fashion will still activate the Innodem's finisher-related evolutions.
**As this weapon is of the dagger classification, it is also able to force slash procs and open enemies for finishers upon usage of a heavy attack.
*Combining {{M|Corrupt Charge}} and {{M|Covert Lethality}} grants a passive minimum 3x [[Melee Combo]], allowing '''Incarnon Imago''' to immediately transform Innodem at will.
*The Innodem's '''Hawk Momentum''' evolution can build and maintain [[Melee Combo]] out of combat at no cost.

==Trivia==
*"Innodem," in Latin, is a present subjunctive form of ''innodo'', which is a verb meaning 'to fasten with a knot' or 'to entangle'.

